  "solution": "Vẽ đồ thị hàm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> trên cùng một hệ trục toạ độ.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3336a799b5ce7601abb1701d389a1dc91ef214823f7e47da67ea71d308788163.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tQuan sát hình vẽ ta thấy trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> đồ thị hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cắt đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> tại hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy các giá trị cần tìm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
